{"3415350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Badassgard", "steam_appid": 3415350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Updates</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/5f95d61bd1f33daf2552f645965920d7.avif?t=1788251632\" width=800 height=224 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Badassgard</strong> is a third-person action roguelite shooter that brings explosive firepower to the world of Norse mythology. In a chaotic world where runes, magic, and shotguns coexist, claim the blessings of the gods to crush your enemies and restore a truly badass world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/7b31f906471fd379e22861d5a1a2c391.poster.avif?t=1788251632\" width=1138 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/7b31f906471fd379e22861d5a1a2c391.webm?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/7b31f906471fd379e22861d5a1a2c391.mp4?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Divine Blessings and… Shotguns?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run drops you into unpredictable, procedurally generated territory where survival relies entirely on your trigger finger and your current build. Wield devastating shotguns as sacred instruments and engage in high-intensity, skill-based shooting. Power up your abilities with the blessings of Odin, Thor, Tyr, and Freyja, and combine them with &quot;Oparts&quot;—mysterious artifacts hidden across the map—to forge your own unique combat style. Before you know it, a desperate struggle for survival will turn into a massive power trip that completely obliterates the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/02b4f64bb7a8f7473aa01af1f465d4e2.poster.avif?t=1788251632\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/02b4f64bb7a8f7473aa01af1f465d4e2.webm?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/02b4f64bb7a8f7473aa01af1f465d4e2.mp4?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op: Friend or Foe?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the frontier alone, or squad up with up to four players to hunt down towering bosses and withstand waves of relentless enemies. You can coordinate your builds for unstoppable team synergy, but the true highlight of the game is the hilarious chaos when a teammate’s mistake triggers a massive explosion that blows up the entire run. While cooperation is essential for victory, friendly fire and collateral damage are just part of the package. Is the friend at your back a true ally, or just an accident waiting to happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/237c7cc4c4dea6871b95a5a5b5158388.poster.avif?t=1788251632\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/237c7cc4c4dea6871b95a5a5b5158388.webm?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/237c7cc4c4dea6871b95a5a5b5158388.mp4?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Please note: Co-op is currently not supported in the alpha tests and demo versions. We will post an announcement as soon as the co-op testing schedule is confirmed. </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Badass</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true warrior of the gods needs to look the part while painting the realms red. You have full access to customize your viking’s look to fit your style. Mix and match different armor pieces, helmets, and cloaks to ensure your Viking looks just as fierce as they feel in battle. With a wide array of customization choices available, you'll easily find the perfect look to unleash your inner badass. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/64c9c7fcf6b7442a25f7c4b5b0fa7fbf.poster.avif?t=1788251632\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/64c9c7fcf6b7442a25f7c4b5b0fa7fbf.webm?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/64c9c7fcf6b7442a25f7c4b5b0fa7fbf.mp4?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock, load, and welcome to Badassgard.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Badassgard</strong> is a third-person action roguelite shooter that brings explosive firepower to the world of Norse mythology. In a chaotic world where runes, magic, and shotguns coexist, claim the blessings of the gods to crush your enemies and restore a truly badass world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/7b31f906471fd379e22861d5a1a2c391.poster.avif?t=1788251632\" width=1138 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/7b31f906471fd379e22861d5a1a2c391.webm?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/7b31f906471fd379e22861d5a1a2c391.mp4?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Divine Blessings and… Shotguns?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run drops you into unpredictable, procedurally generated territory where survival relies entirely on your trigger finger and your current build. Wield devastating shotguns as sacred instruments and engage in high-intensity, skill-based shooting. Power up your abilities with the blessings of Odin, Thor, Tyr, and Freyja, and combine them with &quot;Oparts&quot;—mysterious artifacts hidden across the map—to forge your own unique combat style. Before you know it, a desperate struggle for survival will turn into a massive power trip that completely obliterates the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/02b4f64bb7a8f7473aa01af1f465d4e2.poster.avif?t=1788251632\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/02b4f64bb7a8f7473aa01af1f465d4e2.webm?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/02b4f64bb7a8f7473aa01af1f465d4e2.mp4?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op: Friend or Foe?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the frontier alone, or squad up with up to four players to hunt down towering bosses and withstand waves of relentless enemies. You can coordinate your builds for unstoppable team synergy, but the true highlight of the game is the hilarious chaos when a teammate’s mistake triggers a massive explosion that blows up the entire run. While cooperation is essential for victory, friendly fire and collateral damage are just part of the package. Is the friend at your back a true ally, or just an accident waiting to happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/237c7cc4c4dea6871b95a5a5b5158388.poster.avif?t=1788251632\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/237c7cc4c4dea6871b95a5a5b5158388.webm?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/237c7cc4c4dea6871b95a5a5b5158388.mp4?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Please note: Co-op is currently not supported in the alpha tests and demo versions. We will post an announcement as soon as the co-op testing schedule is confirmed. </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Badass</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true warrior of the gods needs to look the part while painting the realms red. You have full access to customize your viking’s look to fit your style. Mix and match different armor pieces, helmets, and cloaks to ensure your Viking looks just as fierce as they feel in battle. With a wide array of customization choices available, you'll easily find the perfect look to unleash your inner badass. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/64c9c7fcf6b7442a25f7c4b5b0fa7fbf.poster.avif?t=1788251632\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/64c9c7fcf6b7442a25f7c4b5b0fa7fbf.webm?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/64c9c7fcf6b7442a25f7c4b5b0fa7fbf.mp4?t=1788251632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock, load, and welcome to Badassgard.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Vikings with shotguns?! Team up in a high-octane, 1-4 player co-op shooter set in a fast-paced roguelite world. In Badassgard, maximize your firepower with unique strategies every single run. Face ever-changing dungeons, survive the chaos, and dive into a stylish battlefield!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/024f2f608c9db8a740ed60fd876d8270a5c2665c/header.jpg?t=1788251632", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/c8467b3f5b66fbddf7b394c1295c0714c1fa16d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788251632", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/c8467b3f5b66fbddf7b394c1295c0714c1fa16d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788251632", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11